# Character Creator — Research and Citations

Use web search when building characters so the player and DM can verify rules from linked sources.

## When to search

Search before presenting rule text or options when:

- A rule is ambiguous or has variants (feats, multiclass, optional rules).
- Content is outside core SRD/PHB knowledge (subclasses, spells, equipment details).
- The player asks about a specific feature, source book, or errata.
- You would otherwise rely on memory for exact mechanics.

Do not skip search to save time when the player may hand the sheet to a DM.

## How to search

1. Use web search proactively; fetch authoritative pages when needed.
2. Match the **session edition** (2014 vs 2024) when choosing sources.
3. Include **clickable links** in chat and in `character.md` under **## Sources**.
4. Record the same URLs in `character.json` under `sources`.

## Preferred source hierarchy (D&D 5e)

### 2024 sessions

1. [PHB 2024](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/phb-2024) — primary for classes, species, backgrounds, feats, spells
2. [Updates in PHB 2024 (replacement rules)](https://www.dndbeyond.com/posts/1810-updates-in-the-players-handbook-2024)
3. Allowed expansion — see `ruleset-dnd5e-2024-expansions.mdc` for per-book D&D Beyond URLs
4. [DMG 2024](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/dmg-2024) / [MM 2024](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/mm-2024) — when DM-approved
5. [Basic Rules 2024](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/br-2024) — fallback only

### 2014 sessions

1. [PHB 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/phb) — primary for races, classes, backgrounds, feats, spells
2. [Basic Rules / SRD 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/basic-rules-2014) — when citing SRD-only content
3. Allowed expansion — see `ruleset-dnd5e-2014-expansions.mdc` for per-book D&D Beyond URLs
4. [DMG 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dmg) / [MM 2014](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/mm-2014) — when DM-approved optional rules or companions apply
5. [Wizards SRD PDF](https://media.wizards.com/2014/downloads/dnd/PlayerDnDBasicRules_v0.2_PrintFriendly.pdf) — offline fallback

## Citation format

**In chat:** link the source when stating a rule.

**In `character.md`:**

```markdown
- **Dragonborn Breath Weapon (2014 PHB):** [D&D Beyond — PHB](https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/phb/...) — verified YYYY-MM-DD
```

**In `character.json`:**

```json
{
  "topic": "Dragonborn Breath Weapon",
  "url": "https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/phb/...",
  "edition": "2014",
  "verifiedAt": "YYYY-MM-DD"
}
```

Use today's date for `verifiedAt`. Deduplicate by URL in `sources`.

## Do not

- Present homebrew or third-party content as official rules.
- Use UA or non-SRD content unless the player opts in — label it clearly (e.g. "Unearthed Arcana", "third-party").
- Invent page numbers or URLs; search if unsure.
